 da: angular width (degrees), \n#      v: median velocity (km/s)\n#     dv: variation (1 sigma) of velocity over the width of the CME\n#   minv: lowest velocity detected within the CME\n#   maxv: highest velocity detected within the CME\n#  halo?: II if da>90, III if da>180, IV if da>270, indicating potential halo/partial halo CME\n# \n  </PRE>\n <td valign='top'>\n  <PRE>\n# CME |          t0    | dt0| pa | da |  v  |  dv | minv| maxv| halo?\n  <a href=\"CME0027/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0027</a>|2026/07/21 18:48| 01 | 024| 006| 0143| 0102| 0127| 0346|    \n  <a href=\"CME0026/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0026</a>|2026/07/21 15:48| 02 | 037| 024| 0288| 0178| 0121| 0710|    \n  <a href=\"CME0025/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0025</a>|2026/07/21 14:12| 03 | 006| 050| 0525| 0052| 0402| 0625|    \n  <a href=\"CME0024/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0024</a>|2026/07/21 09:36| 05 | 065| 036| 0125| 0026| 0115| 0197|    \n  <a href=\"CME0023/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0023</a>|2026/07/21 09:00| 02 | 240| 006| 0389| 0728| 0214| 1836|    \n  <a href=\"CME0022/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0022</a>|2026/07/21 07:00| 01 | 239| 008| 023"
